{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116290","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116290/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116290/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116290/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116290","id":3941530081,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7q7vnh","number":116290,"title":"Embed as Universal Basis sets cull mode to backface disabled","user":{"login":"elvisish","id":16231628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjMxNjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16231628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish","html_url":"https://github.com/elvisish","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-14T14:16:34Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T11:46:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10, 4.5.stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nSetting the importer to use basis universal doesn't import materials with backface culling on if they are set to it in Blender:\n\n<img width=\"795\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe523c63-9059-4e34-a7e8-599c81241343\" />\n\n<img width=\"670\" height=\"477\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/616d5c9e-dbaa-496f-93ff-b37aba930ede\" />\n\nI wrote an ImportScript to force backface culling on:\n```swift\n@tool\nextends EditorScenePostImport\n\nvar scene_name: StringName\n\n\n# Import script for rig to set up everything so little editing is needed once the character is\n# instantiated.\nfunc _post_import(scene):\n\tscene_name = scene.name + \" Rig\"\n\titerate(scene)\n\treturn scene\n\n\nfunc iterate(node):\n\tif node is MeshInstance3D:\n\t\tvar surf_mat = node.mesh.get(\"surface_0/material\")\n\t\tsurf_mat.set_cull_mode(0)\n\tfor child in node.get_children():\n\t\titerate(child)\n```\nIf I use this script and change the cull mode, the choices are frontfaces only, or backface culling disabled:\n\n<img width=\"1315\" height=\"922\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/564773a1-6b81-421b-a640-c54b0e0e6738\" />\n\n<img width=\"1294\" height=\"652\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc339e8d-8d12-4d8f-82ce-a0e139a64a52\" />\n\n<img width=\"1311\" height=\"417\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/212e933d-ecff-4846-95f5-66d700a10901\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nExport a glb in blender\nSet the textures to keep internal, basis universal\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116290/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116290/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}